  "prefLabel": "Abfd 216.05 Effect of Declaratory Rulings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Abfd 216.05 Effect of Declaratory Rulings. A declaratory ruling shall apply only to the committee and to the person requesting it and shall be confined to the facts presented pursuant to Abfd 216.02(a)(2)-(a)(3) and in response to a request of the committee made pursuant to Abfd 216.03(b).\n\nSource. #7783, eff 10-26-02",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/abfd100-300.html"
